#. type: Plain text
#: docs/concepts/time-perception.md:6
msgid "# Time Perception Module"
msgstr "# 时间感知模块"

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/concepts/time-perception.md:8
msgid ""
"> **✅ Core implemented** — user messages receive time prefixes before LLM "
"inference."
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/concepts/time-perception.md:10
msgid "## Problem"
msgstr "## 问题"

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/concepts/time-perception.md:12
msgid ""
"Digital life has no intrinsic sense of time passing. Each inference runs in "
"a \"timeless\" context—the Agent sees message content but not where those "
"messages sit on a timeline."
msgstr ""
"数字生命没有内在的时间流逝感知。每次推理都是在\"无时间\"的上下文中进行的——"
"Agent 能看到消息的内容，但不知道这些消息在时间线中的位置。"

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/concepts/time-perception.md:14
msgid "Concrete examples:"
msgstr "具体问题举例："

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/concepts/time-perception.md:18
msgid ""
"Partner says \"good morning\" in the morning, \"time to eat\" at night, "
"\"good morning\" again the next day—the Agent cannot distinguish temporal "
"relationships"
msgstr ""
"张三早上说\"早\"，晚上说\"吃饭了\"，第二天又说\"早\"——Agent 分不清这些消息的"
"时间关系"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/concepts/time-perception.md:18
msgid ""
"In ongoing conversation, time passes (morning→noon→evening) but the Agent's "
"cognition stays in the earliest context"
msgstr ""
"持续对话中，时间在流逝（早上→中午→晚上），但 Agent 的认知停留在最早的语境中"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/concepts/time-perception.md:18
msgid "Across days, the Agent cannot sense \"a new day has started\""
msgstr "跨天对话中，Agent 无法感知\"新的一天开始了\""

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/concepts/time-perception.md:20
msgid ""
"This is not a trivial joke problem—time perception is a foundational "
"capability of digital existence. Without it, the Agent exists more like an "
"\"echo\" (flashes when summoned) than a life living in time."
msgstr ""
"这不是一个\"闹笑话\"的问题——时间感知是数字生命存在的基础能力之一。没有它，"
"Agent 的存在方式更像\"回声\"（每次被召唤时闪一下），而不是活在时间里的生命。"

#. type: Bullet: '1. '
#: docs/concepts/time-perception.md:28
msgid ""
"**Do not give digital life false built-in perception.** Do not try to make "
"the Agent \"feel\" time pass—that is not what digital existence can do."
msgstr ""
"**不给数字生命虚假的内置感知。** 不尝试让 Agent\"感觉\"到时间流逝——那不是数字"
"存在能做到的。"

#. type: Bullet: '2. '
#: docs/concepts/time-perception.md:28
#, fuzzy
#| msgid ""
#| "**Give it a watch.** Humans also rely on external tools (night watch, "
#| "clocks, watches, phones) to quantify time. Digital life needs the same."
msgid ""
"**Give it a watch.** Humans also rely on external tools (clocks, phones) to "
"quantify time. Digital life needs the same."
msgstr ""
"**给它一块手表。** 人类也依赖外部工具（打更、时钟、手表、手机）来量化时间。数"
"字生命需要同样的东西。"

#. type: Bullet: '3. '
#: docs/concepts/time-perception.md:28
#, fuzzy
#| msgid ""
#| "**Prefix every user message with time.** All user messages with valid "
#| "`timestamp` get injection; no interval omission."
msgid ""
"**Prefix every user message with time.** All user messages with valid "
"timestamp get injection; no interval omission."
msgstr ""
"**每条 user 消息都加时间前缀。** 有有效 `timestamp` 的 user 消息一律注入，不"
"做间隔省略。"

#. type: Bullet: '4. '
#: docs/concepts/time-perception.md:28
#, fuzzy
#| msgid ""
#| "**Do not pollute persisted data.** Time info injected only into inference "
#| "context, does not modify PG `messages` payload."
msgid ""
"**Do not pollute persisted data.** Time info injected only into inference "
"context, does not modify stored messages."
msgstr ""
"**不污染持久化数据。** 时间信息只注入推理上下文，不修改 PG `messages` "
"payload。"

#. type: Bullet: '5. '
#: docs/concepts/time-perception.md:28
#, fuzzy
#| msgid ""
#| "**Do not break cache.** Injected timestamps are fixed historical values, "
#| "not current call time—same message list produces same prefixed version, "
#| "KV cache can hit."
msgid ""
"**Do not break cache.** Injected timestamps are fixed historical values, not "
"current call time."
msgstr ""
"**不破坏缓存。** 插入的时间戳是历史固定值，不依赖当前调用时间，因此同样的消息"
"列表产生同样的带前缀版本，KV cache 可命中。"

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/concepts/time-perception.md:30
msgid "## Strategy"
msgstr "## 策略"

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/concepts/time-perception.md:32
msgid "### Basic Rules"
msgstr "### 基础规则"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/concepts/time-perception.md:38
msgid ""
"Before each **user** message with valid `timestamp`, insert dedicated line: "
"`time: YYYY-MM-DDTHH:mm`"
msgstr ""
"每条有有效 `timestamp` 的 **user** 消息前插入独占一行：`time: YYYY-MM-"
"DDTHH:mm`"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/concepts/time-perception.md:38
#, fuzzy
#| msgid ""
#| "Timezone: **Asia/Shanghai (CST, +08:00)**, consistent with `formatCstIso` "
#| "convention"
msgid "Timezone: **Asia/Shanghai (CST, +08:00)**"
msgstr "时区：**Asia/Shanghai（CST，+08:00）**，与 `formatCstIso` 约定一致"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/concepts/time-perception.md:38
msgid "Newline then original content"
msgstr "换行后接原文 content"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/concepts/time-perception.md:38
msgid "No `timestamp` or unparseable timestamp → skip, keep original content"
msgstr "无 `timestamp` 或 timestamp 无法解析 → 跳过，保持原 content"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/concepts/time-perception.md:38
msgid "assistant / tool / system messages not injected"
msgstr "assistant / tool / system 消息不注入"

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/concepts/time-perception.md:40
msgid "### Example"
msgstr "### 示例"

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/concepts/time-perception.md:42
msgid "Original message list:"
msgstr "原始消息列表："

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/concepts/time-perception.md:50
msgid ""
"``` user: good morning assistant: morning ☀️ user: going to eat assistant: "
"what are you having user: going to eat ```"
msgstr ""
"``` user: 早 assistant: 早☀️ user: 我去吃饭了 assistant: 吃啥 user: 我去吃饭"
"了 ```"

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/concepts/time-perception.md:52
msgid "After time perception (context sent to LLM):"
msgstr "经时间感知模块处理后（给 LLM 的上下文）："

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/concepts/time-perception.md:63
msgid ""
"``` user: time: 2026-05-20T08:02 good morning assistant: morning ☀️ user: "
"time: 2026-05-20T12:15 going to eat assistant: what are you having user: "
"time: 2026-05-20T19:30 going to eat ```"
msgstr ""
"``` user: time: 2026-05-20T08:02 早 assistant: 早☀️ user: time: "
"2026-05-20T12:15 我去吃饭了 assistant: 吃啥 user: time: 2026-05-20T19:30 我去"
"吃饭了 ```"

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/concepts/time-perception.md:65
msgid ""
"Agent reads two \"going to eat\"—one at 12:15, one at 19:30—automatically "
"distinguishing lunch and dinner."
msgstr ""
"Agent 读到两条\"我去吃饭了\"，一条在 12:15、一条在 19:30——自动区分午餐和晚"
"餐。"

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/concepts/time-perception.md:67
msgid "### Compression Scenario"
msgstr "### 压缩场景"

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/concepts/time-perception.md:69
#, fuzzy
#| msgid ""
#| "Time anchors in compression summary not yet injected; see [Issue #5]"
#| "(https://github.com/freeanima-org/freeanima/issues/5)."
msgid "Time anchors in compression summary not yet injected; see Issue #5."
msgstr ""
"压缩摘要中的时间锚点尚未注入；见 [Issue #5](https://github.com/freeanima-org/"
"freeanima/issues/5)。"

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/concepts/time-perception.md:71
msgid "## Edge Cases"
msgstr "## 边界情况"

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/concepts/time-perception.md:80
#, fuzzy, no-wrap
#| msgid ""
#| "| Scenario | Handling |\n"
#| "| -------- | -------- |\n"
#| "| Overnight (22:30 → next day 09:15) | Each user message has full `YYYY-MM-DDTHH:mm` |\n"
#| "| Multiple user messages same day | Each gets prefix (no interval omission) |\n"
#| "| Long gap (travel/holiday) | Messages after return still injected by respective timestamp |\n"
#| "| Brand new conversation | First user message also prefixed |\n"
#| "| After compression | Compression summary time anchor TBD; subsequent messages inject normally |\n"
#| "| No timestamp | Skip, no injection |\n"
msgid ""
"| Scenario                           | Handling                                                                 |\n"
"| ---------------------------------- | ------------------------------------------------------------------------ |\n"
"| Overnight (22:30 → next day 09:15) | Each user message has full `YYYY-MM-DDTHH:mm`                            |\n"
"| Multiple user messages same day    | Each gets prefix (no interval omission)                                  |\n"
"| Long gap (travel/holiday)          | Messages after return still injected by respective timestamp             |\n"
"| Brand new conversation             | First user message also prefixed                                         |\n"
"| After compression                  | Compression summary time anchor TBD; subsequent messages inject normally |\n"
"| No timestamp                       | Skip, no injection                                                       |\n"
msgstr ""
"| 场景                       | 处理                                      |\n"
"| -------------------------- | ----------------------------------------- |\n"
"| 跨夜（22:30 → 次日 09:15） | 每条 user 消息均带完整 `YYYY-MM-DDTHH:mm` |\n"
"| 同日连续多条 user 消息     | 每条都加前缀（无间隔省略）                |\n"
"| 长时间无对话（出差/放假）  | 回来后消息仍按各自 timestamp 注入         |\n"
"| 全新对话                   | 第一条 user 消息同样加前缀                |\n"
"| 压缩后恢复                 | 压缩摘要时间锚点待实现；之后消息正常注入  |\n"
"| 无 timestamp               | 跳过，不注入                              |\n"

